Added files
-----------
- selfservice/strategy/ldap/                LDAP login strategy (all files)
- persistence/sql/migrations/sql/20240216140601000000_credential_types_ldap.*.sql
                                            Adds the "ldap" credential type
- contrib/quickstart/kratos/ldap/           Example configuration and identity schema
- README_LDAP.md                            LDAP strategy design and operations guide
- NOTICE                                    This file

Modified files
--------------
- driver/registry_default.go                Registers the LDAP strategy
- driver/registry_default_test.go           Expects the LDAP strategy in the strategy lists
- embedx/config.schema.json                 LDAP method configuration (including multiple
                                            search bases and TLS) and after-login hooks
- embedx/embedx_test.go                     Tests for the LDAP configuration schema
- embedx/identity_extension.schema.json     ory.sh/kratos credentials.ldap.identifier
- go.mod, go.sum                            Adds github.com/go-ldap/ldap/v3
- identity/credentials.go                   Adds the "ldap" credential type
- identity/handler.go                       Creates LDAP credentials for identities created
                                            with schema "ldap" (identityFromCreateIdentityBody)
- schema/errors.go                          Adds NewLDAPStatusServiceUnavailable
- selfservice/flow/login/sort.go            Orders LDAP UI nodes
- selfservice/flow/registration/sort.go     Orders LDAP UI nodes
- selfservice/flow/settings/hook.go         Maps the "ldap" method to its UI node group
- selfservice/flow/settings/sort.go         Orders LDAP UI nodes
- selfservice/hook/web_hook.go              Copies the identity ID from webhook responses
                                            (parseWebhookResponse)
- text/id.go                                Adds the ErrorLdapServiceUnavailable message ID
- text/message_validation.go                Adds the LDAP service unavailable message
- ui/node/node.go                           Adds the "ldap" UI node group

